  "review_conclusions": [
    "Time owns one domain context and one observation. Built-in contexts copy independently; copied values and borrowed contexts do not sample or acquire Runtime/World advancement authority. Even zero delta advances the saturated frame index.",
    "Virtual retains configured rate,paused flag and last effective sampled rate separately. A pause/unpause/rate update changes future sampling; the cached effective rate refreshes when the next real delta is consumed,including zero-delta advances.",
    "Virtual scaling checks zero and clamps nonfinite/oversized products before Duration conversion. Nonzero maximum and finite nonnegative rates are maintained by setters; negative zero is accepted.",
    "Fixed owns nonzero timestep and unconsumed debt. available_steps divides nanoseconds then applies the u32 budget; planning predicts consumed/remaining durations without mutating debt. A successful production commit takes one step and then advances Time; insufficient debt preserves the observation.",
    "FixedStepPlan is a copyable public-field DTO. Its constructor does not validate consistency,default timestep can be zero,and fractional f32 conversion can round to1.0. A plan is neither a World identity nor a commit token.",
    "Runtime time policy preparation checks values and changes future World defaults. World policy application first rejects an active step and rejects a timestep change with any existing debt; accepted virtual/fixed changes update only their respective epochs before returning a receipt.",
    "Domain registry and marker constants classify duration/calendar domains without instantiating a clock. Stamp id/epoch/source-generation do not identify a World; repeated configuration or source values can saturate and callers must already know ownership.",
    "The product policy keeps profile/version/budget outside the extracted low-level transaction. Session construction preserves the product value and tick_frame passes its budget into the outer snapshot; FFI decodes checked profile bytes rather than transferring these Rust DTO layouts.",
    "Level checks World generation before committing,controller checks active tick identity,and WorldDriver commits only after its fixed stages succeed. Abort preserves debt; physics consumes the selected tick delta while real frame index is diagnostic context.",
    "The three owned product tests and adjacent source fixtures were inspected. Raw source predicates preserve their exact selected inputs;75 contributions cover only the15 scoped production files,with the tests subdirectory excluded by the real collector."
  ],
